# Prototype scope

- Phase 0 delivers hygiene, docs, rules, and a building Figma frontend only
- Do not implement backend business logic, real Jira/ADO clients, or OpenAI calls in Phase 0
- Do not delete Figma source files (`.figma/`, screens, tokens)
- Do not rewrite Git history without explicitly reporting first
- Leave mocked handlers in place until the matching implementation phase
- Prefer documentation and safe scaffolding over speculative abstractions
